urrent resume or career details, if you have them, to work on during the course."],"targetAudience":["Students and graduates writing their first resume","Job seekers who are not getting interview calls","Professionals updating their resume for a new role"],"seoTitle":"Resume Writing Course: The Perfect Resume","seoDescription":"Write a one-page resume hiring managers notice: compelling bullet points, your unique selling proposition and a cover letter that shows your potential.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/resume-writing-course-perfect-resume.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":1.4,"videos":19},{"id":"course-adilo-55ec1c7z","slug":"complete-guide-to-job-interviews","title":"From Preparation to Follow-Up: A Complete Guide to Job Interviews","subtitle":"Prepare for every stage of a job interview: set goals, research the company, dress the part, rehearse your story, handle rejection and follow up.","description":"This course takes you through a job interview from start to finish, so you know what to do before, during and after it.\n\nIn 17 video lessons you will define clear objectives, research the organisation before the interview, choose the right professional dress code and build connections that support your job search. You will craft a professional narrative that helps you stand out and prepare your mind for the pressure of an interview.\n\nYou will then rehearse your interview, learn how to move from interview to offer, sharpen your communication and handle rejection in a way that keeps you moving forward.","category":"Career Development","categorySlug":"career-development","level":"Beginner","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Set clear objectives for each job interview","Research a company effectively before the interview","Choose an appropriate professional dress code","Craft and rehearse a professional narrative that stands out","Prepare mentally for interview pressure","Handle rejection and plan your next steps"],"prerequisites":["No prior interview training is required.","A device with internet access to watch the video lessons."],"targetAudience":["Job seekers preparing for upcoming interviews","Students and fresh graduates entering the job market","Anyone who wants a step-by-step interview routine"],"seoTitle":"Complete Guide to Job Interviews","seoDescription":"How to prepare for a job interview step by step: set goals, research the company, dress right, rehearse your story, handle rejection and follow up.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/complete-guide-to-job-interviews.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":1.0,"videos":17},{"id":"course-adilo-39nitmwa","slug":"how-to-land-your-first-internship","title":"How to Land Your First Internship: Resume, LinkedIn, Interviews and Offers","subtitle":"Find, apply for and win your first internship, then turn it into a full-time offer.","description":"Getting your first internship can feel impossible without experience. This course gives you a clear, step-by-step plan.\n\nAcross 29 video lessons you will set your goals, build self-awareness and explore internship opportunities. You will create an impressive resume, a stand-out cover letter and a strong LinkedIn profile, use networking to find openings and avoid common pitfalls in your search.\n\nYou will prepare for and nail the interview, overcome interview anxiety, handle rejections and turn skills gaps to your advantage. Finally, you will learn how to negotiate your offer, make the most of your internship and turn it into a full-time offer.","category":"Career Development","categorySlug":"career-development","level":"Beginner","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Set clear goals for your internship search","Create an internship-ready resume and cover letter","Build a strong LinkedIn profile and use networking to find openings","Prepare for internship interviews and manage interview anxiety","Handle rejections and present skills gaps positively","Make the most of your internship and work towards a full-time offer"],"prerequisites":["No prior work experience is required.","A device with internet access to watch the video lessons."],"targetAudience":["College and university students looking for their first internship","Fresh graduates seeking work experience","Career changers exploring internships in a new field"],"seoTitle":"How to Get Your First Internship","seoDescription":"Land your first internship: resume, cover letter and LinkedIn, networking, interview tips, handling rejection and turning an internship into a job.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/how-to-land-your-first-internship.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":2.0,"videos":29},{"id":"course-adilo-zlxq61yx","slug":"salary-negotiation-course","title":"Mastering Salary Negotiation: How to Ask for a Raise and Secure Your Worth","subtitle":"Use a four-step negotiation framework, build your value sheet and present a confident case for a salary increase.","description":"Asking for more money is uncomfortable for most people. This salary negotiation course gives you a framework and the preparation to ask with confidence.\n\nOver 28 video lessons you will learn a four-step negotiation framework, how to request a pay rise and how to understand and articulate your value. You will define your goals, build a value sheet, present your case, perfect your pitch and plan your salary increase step by step.\n\nThe course also covers closing the gender gap with effective negotiation tactics, assessing your market worth, performance-based increases, how often to raise the topic, when to schedule the discussion, workplace dynamics and winning over your boss. You will learn how to turn disappointment into action and how to set SMART learning goals for your growth.","category":"Career Development","categorySlug":"career-development","level":"All Levels","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Apply a four-step framework to salary negotiations","Understand and articulate your value to your employer","Build a value sheet that supports your request","Plan, time and present your case for a salary increase","Assess your market worth before you negotiate","Respond constructively if your request is declined"],"prerequisites":["No negotiation experience is required.","Useful if you are currently employed or have a job offer to negotiate."],"targetAudience":["Employees preparing to ask for a raise","Job seekers negotiating a new offer","Professionals who want to be paid what they are worth"],"seoTitle":"Salary Negotiation Course: Ask for a Raise","seoDescription":"Learn salary negotiation with a four-step framework: know your market worth, build a value sheet and ask for a raise with confidence. 28 lessons.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/salary-negotiation-course.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":2.2,"videos":28},{"id":"course-adilo-7wenqs4i","slug":"phone-communication-skills-course","title":"Mastering Phone Conversations: Confident Professional Phone Communication","subtitle":"Speak clearly, listen actively, build rapport and handle cold calls and difficult conversations over the phone with confidence.","description":"Phone calls are still where many business relationships are won or lost. This course helps you handle every call with clarity and confidence.\n\nIn 21 video lessons you will learn best practices for clear telephone communication, assess and audit your own phone conversations, and record your calls for self-improvement. You will practise active listening, turn cold calls into engaging conversations, avoid the pitfalls of speakerphones and rehearse your calls.\n\nYou will also learn to build rapport with strangers, take useful notes during calls, manage difficult dialogues constructively and decide when a video call works better than a phone call.","category":"Communication Skills","categorySlug":"communication-skills","level":"All Levels","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Communicate clearly and professionally on the phone","Assess and improve your own phone conversations","Use active listening techniques during calls","Turn cold calls into engaging conversations","Build rapport with people you have never met","Handle difficult phone conversations constructively"],"prerequisites":["No prior training is required.","A phone you can practise with is helpful."],"targetAudience":["Professionals who make or take business calls","Sales, support and customer-facing teams","Anyone who feels nervous on the phone"],"seoTitle":"Phone Communication Skills Course","seoDescription":"Improve your phone communication skills: speak clearly, listen actively, handle cold calls and difficult conversations and build rapport on every call.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/phone-communication-skills-course.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":1.4,"videos":21},{"id":"course-adilo-ik69hq6b","slug":"communication-skills-course","title":"Mastering the Art of Communication: Essential Social and Communication Skills","subtitle":"Start conversations with confidence, listen well, persuade and influence, give constructive feedback and show appreciation that strengthens relationships.","description":"Strong communication skills help in every part of work and life. This course gives you practical techniques for everyday professional conversations.\n\nIn 14 video lessons you will learn how to break the ice and start conversations with confidence, make others feel valued through recognition, and win hearts and minds in business. You will develop professional listening skills and apply key strategies for agreement and collaboration.\n\nYou will also learn to build compelling arguments that influence decisions, give constructive praise that lifts team morale, provide thoughtful critiques in difficult conversations and write meaningful thank-you messages for networking.","category":"Communication Skills","categorySlug":"communication-skills","level":"All Levels","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Start conversations with confidence","Make others feel recognised and valued","Listen effectively in professional situations","Build compelling arguments and influence decisions","Give constructive praise and thoughtful critiques","Write meaningful thank-you messages for networking"],"prerequisites":["No prior training is required."],"targetAudience":["Professionals who want to communicate and collaborate better","Team leaders and managers","Students preparing for the workplace"],"seoTitle":"Communication Skills Course: Social Skills","seoDescription":"Build communication and social skills: start conversations with confidence, listen well, persuade, give constructive feedback and show appreciation.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/communication-skills-course.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":1.5,"videos":14},{"id":"course-adilo-upmknymt","slug":"public-speaking-course-for-beginners","title":"Mastering the Art of Public Speaking: Essential Techniques for Beginners","subtitle":"Overcome speaking anxiety, structure your message, tell stories that land and rehearse on video to present with confidence.","description":"Public speaking is a skill you can learn. This beginner course takes you from nervous to prepared, one technique at a time.\n\nIn 23 video lessons you will learn strategies to move from classroom to stage, use storytelling so your presentations deliver results, reduce anxiety in professional settings and identify the key messages of your talk. You will build confidence for unfamiliar topics and learn how to narrow down your ideas to the strongest concepts.\n\nYou will practise with three step-by-step video rehearsals, develop your speaking voice, choose the right tech tools, prepare your key points and learn persuasion techniques used by politicians, ending with how public speaking supports your career.","category":"Communication Skills","categorySlug":"communication-skills","level":"Beginner","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Reduce anxiety when speaking in professional settings","Structure a talk around clear key messages","Use storytelling and examples to engage an audience","Rehearse effectively using video recordings","Use your voice to strengthen your delivery","Prepare persuasive key points for presentations"],"prerequisites":["No public speaking experience is required.","A phone or camera for the video rehearsal exercises is helpful."],"targetAudience":["Beginners who feel nervous speaking in front of others","Students preparing presentations","Professionals who present at work"],"seoTitle":"Public Speaking Course for Beginners","seoDescription":"A public speaking course for beginners: manage anxiety, structure key messages, tell stories, rehearse on video and present with confidence.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/public-speaking-course-for-beginners.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":1.3,"videos":23},{"id":"course-3bda155b","slug":"creative-writing-course-for-beginners","title":"Creative Writing for Beginners: Mastering the Art of Writing","subtitle":"Write with confidence: craft strong openings and vivid imagery, find inspiration, build a writing routine, revise like a professional and protect your work.","description":"Discover the craft of writing in this creative writing course for beginners. Across 32 video lessons you will build practical writing skills and a habit that lasts.\n\nYou will learn strategies for impactful beginnings, the equipment you need to get started, how to develop word sketches, use sense impressions for vivid imagery, notice nuances and adapt your voice and tone. You will find inspiration outdoors, write productively on the go, write honestly without filters and learn to keep turning up to write.\n\nThe course also covers using white space, the differences between fiction and nonfiction, short stories and novels, poetry and prose, and a professional draft–revise–repeat approach. You will work with writing prompts, establish a routine, learn to observe like a writer and understand the difference between plagiarism and inspiration, along with copyright basics to protect your work.","category":"Communication Skills","categorySlug":"communication-skills","level":"Beginner","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Write impactful openings that draw readers in","Use sense impressions and detail to create vivid imagery","Adapt your voice and tone to different kinds of writing","Build a consistent writing routine","Understand fiction, nonfiction, short stories, novels, poetry and prose","Revise your drafts with a professional approach","Borrow ethically and protect your own work with copyright basics"],"prerequisites":["No prior creative writing experience is required.","A notebook or digital document for writing exercises."],"targetAudience":["Beginners who want to start writing","Students who want to improve their writing","Aspiring authors, bloggers and content writers"],"seoTitle":"Creative Writing Course for Beginners","seoDescription":"Creative writing course for beginners: strong openings, vivid imagery, writing prompts, a daily routine, revision techniques and copyright basics.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/creative-writing-course-for-beginners.jpg","existing":true,"price":null,"originalPrice":null,"hours":2.9,"videos":32},{"id":"course-adilo-wqvdq40t","slug":"personal-branding-course","title":"Mastering Your Identity: A Tactical Plan for Building Your Personal Brand","subtitle":"Define your brand story and value proposition, grow it with content, social media and livestreams, and turn your personal brand into opportunities.","description":"Your personal brand shapes how people see you before they meet you. This course gives you a tactical plan to build it deliberately.\n\nIn 20 video lessons you will learn why personal branding matters, the foundations of a strong brand, how to develop a compelling brand story and how to craft your value proposition. You will build authority and engagement with content marketing, plan a content calendar and use social media and livestreams to amplify your brand.\n\nYou will also explore how to turn your passion into profit, build a website that supports your brand, establish authority, engage your audience through speaking and keep your brand evolving as you grow.","category":"Career Development","categorySlug":"career-development","level":"All Levels","language":"English","learningOutcomes":["Explain why a personal brand matters for your career","Develop a compelling personal brand story","Craft a clear value proposition","Plan content with a content marketing calendar","Use social media and livestreams to grow your brand","Build authority and explore ways to monetise your brand"],"prerequisites":["No prior marketing experience is required."],"targetAudience":["Professionals building their reputation","Freelancers, consultants and creators","Students preparing to stand out in the job market"],"seoTitle":"Personal Branding Course: Build Your Brand","seoDescription":"Build your personal brand with a tactical plan: brand story, value proposition, content calendar, social media, livestreams and monetisation ideas.","thumbnail":"https://edufyacademy.com/images/courses/personal-branding-course.jpg","existing":false,"price":199,"originalPrice":2499,"hours":1.8,"videos":20}],"sections":[{"id":"sec-c27757e89b","course":"course-c3f139cd","title":"Getting Started with the POWER Interview Framework","ord":1,"description":"Meet your trainer, see what the course covers and how to move through it."},{"id":"sec-541822b4ed","course":"course-c3f139cd","title":"Interview Preparation: The POWER Framework, Your Resume and Q&A","ord":2,"description":"Learn the POWER framework, read corporate cult